  "prefLabel": "Den 101.30 Registration",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.30 “Registration” means to secure official entry on the roster of persons having a dental or dental hygiene license in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #7671, eff 4-4-02; ss and moved by #8224, eff 12-8-04 (formerly Den 101.19); renumbered by #12427 (formerly Den 101.22); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.26)",
